#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:98
msgid "Structure report"
msgstr "Bilan de structure"

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:99
msgid "Every tab of the dashboard of a structure: output, collaborations, impact, journals, funding, teams…"
msgstr "Tous les onglets du tableau de bord d'une structure : production, collaborations, impact, revues, financements, équipes…"

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:129
msgid "International collaborations"
msgstr "Collaborations internationales"

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:130
msgid "Share and evolution of international co-publications, partner countries and institutions, themes and impact."
msgstr "Part et évolution des co-publications internationales, pays et établissements partenaires, thématiques et impact."

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:143
msgid "Partner countries"
msgstr "Pays partenaires"

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:147
msgid "Themes of international co-publications"
msgstr "Thématiques des co-publications internationales"

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:149
msgid "Impact of international co-publications"
msgstr "Impact des co-publications internationales"

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:166
msgid "Collaboration with a country"
msgstr "Collaboration avec un pays"

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:167
msgid "Co-publications with one partner country: key figures and rank, institutions and map, labs and researchers involved, who works with whom, themes and specialization, impact, funders, list of publications."
msgstr "Co-publications avec un pays partenaire : chiffres clés et rang, établissements et carte, labos et chercheurs impliqués, qui travaille avec qui, thématiques et spécialisation, impact, financeurs, liste des publications."

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:184
#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:217
msgid "Co-publications of {lab} with {countryName}."
msgstr "Co-publications de {lab} avec {countryName}."

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:186
msgid "A publication is a co-publication with {countryName} when one of its authors is affiliated with an institution of that country."
msgstr "Une publication est une co-publication avec {countryName} quand l'un de ses auteurs est affilié à un établissement de ce pays."

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:187
#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:261
msgid "Publications with more than {LARGE_COLLAB_AUTHORS} authors (large consortia) are counted in the volumes but left out of the impact indicators and charts."
msgstr "Les publications de plus de {LARGE_COLLAB_AUTHORS} auteurs (grands consortiums) sont comptées dans les volumes mais écartées des indicateurs et graphiques d'impact."

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:188
msgid "The impact reference is the other international co-publications of {lab} in the same subfields, weighted like the co-publications with {countryName}."
msgstr "La référence d'impact est l'ensemble des autres co-publications internationales de {lab} dans les mêmes sous-disciplines, pondérées comme les co-publications avec {countryName}."

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:189
msgid "Funders are those the publications acknowledge: they say neither who paid the research nor who holds the grant."
msgstr "Les financeurs sont ceux que les publications remercient : ils ne disent ni qui a payé la recherche ni qui porte le financement."

#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:193
#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:269
#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:328
#: components/dashboard/report/templates.ts:359
